      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@Feinsand 12/ My take: “turf” is the clean explanation.\n\nThe real story is the last 24 months of poker.\n\nVlad got the long-term bag.\nBo wanted top-of-market flexibility.\nToronto chose the safer foundation.",
      "lang" : "en",
