      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "@Feinsand 11/ And Toronto didn’t just “let a star walk” and call it a day.\n\nThey went shopping: Dylan Cease headlined a massive offseason.\n\nKazuma Okamoto basically becomes the infield bat replacement.\n\nThis is still a “win now” roster.",
