      "full_text" : "@Feinsand 10/ Meanwhile, the idea that players don’t like Toronto? Nah.\n\nShane Bieber could’ve hit free agency and chose to opt in and stay.\n\nThat tells you the clubhouse + city are a draw, not a deterrent.",
