      "created_at" : "Sun Nov 02 18:12:39 +0000 2025",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "3/ ALCS vs Mariners: Seven-game epic.\nRoad split (G1/G2 Ls burned, but we answered), then home thunder—G3/G4 romps, G5 steal, G6 heart-stopper. Game 7 at Rogers? Gausman/Springer duo slams door, Yesavage grows up. Oct 20 clinch: First WS trip since '93. Seattle who?",
      "lang" : "en",
