      "full_text" : "VICTORY LAP CASHED 🧠💰\n\nTOR wins 6-2.  \nOVER 8.0 gets pushed (8 runs).  \n+2.51 &amp; +1.87 locked in before first pitch.\n\nI don’t post vibes. I post edges that feel *wrong* to the books.  \nTonight they paid.\n\nG5 locks drop at 5 PM. Follow for receipts, not noise. #WANTITALL https://t.co/zpich0OUbQ",
