      "created_at" : "Mon Mar 16 18:08:07 +0000 2026",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "Audi are in that awkward zone where they don’t look hopeless, but they also don’t scare anyone yet.\n\nWilliams got something on the board, but I’m not moving them out of the basement cluster yet.\nCadillac and Aston Martin stay buried.",
      "lang" : "en",
