      "created_at" : "Sun Mar 01 13:53:27 +0000 2026",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "Also, the month was built more on consistency than hero plays.\n\nPromos can help. Parlays can have a place. But most of the progress came from staying selective and not chasing.",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "ThomsFoolery",
