      "created_at" : "Sun Mar 01 13:52:58 +0000 2026",
      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "What helped most was discipline:\n\n-smaller stakes\n-picking spots instead of forcing action\n-checking if the spread or total had better value than the obvious moneyline\n-not betting just because I wanted a team to win",
      "lang" : "en",
      "in_reply_to_screen_name" : "ThomsFoolery",
