      "favorited" : false,
      "full_text" : "Don’t always bet on your favorite team. I wanted Canada to win men's Olympic hockey. I cheer for the Blue Jays. But if the number looks wrong on the other side, I’ll bet against who I want to win. Profit matters more than fandom.",
      "lang" : "en",
